   "max_quanta": 1,
   "note": "two-qubit RB infidelity 7.9(2)e-4 on Helios, gate time about 70 us. Error per quantum (derived): Bell-state fidelity 0.993(1) near the ground state and 0.974(1) at n-bar 20(2), the same MS gate (arXiv:0810.0670 Sec. 5.2), i.e. 9.5e-4 per quantum. max_quanta is R7's gate budget, a rule of the boards, not a measurement",
   "source": "arXiv:2511.05465 Table II and p.5; arXiv:0810.0670 Sec. 5.2",
   "us": 70
  },
  "reset": {
